### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "P-001",
  "name": "Blue T-Shirt",
  "description": "Cotton t-shirt, slim fit",
  "price": 2500,
  "discount": 10,
  "attributes": {
    "category": "clothing",
    "subcategory": "t-shirts",
    "brand": "Acme",
    "kind": "casual",
    "type": "regular",
    "unit": "piece",
    "year": "2026",
    "season": "summer",
    "origin": "Turkey"
  },
  "barcode": 1234567890,
  "color_id": null,
  "size_id": null
}

### Get a product by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List products (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
